    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d167-f1" n="7" type="source" xml:id="d167-f1-content">
                <p>This Record of Decisions was approved by the Council without amendment at its
                    27th meeting, September 29, 1945. For the record of the Council’s 11th meeting,
                    see C.F.M.(P) (45) 11th Meeting, <ref target="#pg248">p. 248</ref>.</p>
            </note>
